R6: sl@corner {3ch=dc 2dc 3ch 3dc}@same [3dc@sp]x4 [{3dc 3ch 3dc}@corner [3dc@sp]x4]x3 ss@top fo
R7: ch {sc 3ch sc}@corner [3ch 2sk sc@sp]x5 3ch [{sc 3ch sc}@corner [3ch 2sk sc@sp]x5 3ch]x3 join
